cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its reported results, please cite this repository and record the commit used."
type: software
title: "Customer Pilot Evidence Pack: auditable retrieval pilot reports"
authors:
  - family-names: Legotin
    given-names: Artem
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-10-16"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arlegotin/customer-pilot-evidence-pack"
url: "https://github.com/arlegotin/customer-pilot-evidence-pack"
license:
  - AGPL-3.0-only
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Local Python tooling for freezing retrieval evaluation evidence, preserving
  assignment and physical-attempt accounting, and producing qualified JSON and
  static HTML reports. Two real NEEDLE packets cover 649 distinct queries and
  160 source groups. Supported native and independent scores reconcile and
  reports reproduce offline. Missing actual comparison conditions block both
  requested provider comparisons. Workflow value is neutral: the existing
  reusable baseline also handled the second packet through configuration, so
  reduced bespoke preparation was not demonstrated.
keywords:
  - retrieval evaluation
  - evidence provenance
  - reproducible research
  - pilot evaluation
  - missing outcomes
